1212	We sweep LoRA~\citep{hu2022lora} across three axes to ensure the comparison in Table~\ref{tab:baselines} is not cherry-picked: rank $r{\in}\{8,16,32\}$, target projections ${\in}\{q{+}v,\; q{+}k{+}v{+}o\}$, and forecast head ${\in}\{$linear, 2-layer MLP$\}$, for 12 configurations $\times$ 3 seeds $=$ 36 runs per dataset (108 runs total across the 3 datasets). All runs use a strictly frozen backbone (matching Table~\ref{tab:rrmoa}'s primary setting).
